# The champion with the interception off (intercept 0): the reserve
# keeps gathering toward the wave whatever raider stands inside the
# outpost radius, instead of turning on it. Built from the kill-ledger
# read of the 96 certified bar seeds (attrbar96, log 2026-09-13): in the
# 1,000-1,500 window a Very Hard loss dies at the wins' rate and kills
# a fifth fewer rival units at every starting size of the rival's army,
# while intercepting two and a half times as often, dying more at home
# and razing less -- the interception spends the reserve on raiders it
# does not kill. The flag was never in the population search's genome
# and has never been priced on the champion. Every other knob and every
# goals slot is the champion's exactly.
name evolve1-g4m2-noicpt
